{"id":"marcha","lemma":"marcha","pos":"noun","rank":853,"glosses":["march","departure","gear (of a motor vehicle, a particular combination or choice of interlocking gears)"],"ipa":"/ˈmaɾt͡ʃa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"marchas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-marcha.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me fui de marcha.","en":"I went hiking.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440512","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"¿A qué hora te marchas?","en":"What time are you leaving?","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"hour"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"No pude poner mi coche en marcha.","en":"I couldn't get my car started.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515129","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to put, to place"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"car, automobile"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"No dé marcha atrás que hay un árbol.","en":"Don't back up. There's a tree behind you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522055","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"behind"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tree"}]},{"text":"Es peligroso saltar de un tren en marcha.","en":"It's dangerous to jump off a moving train.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/943436","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"perilous, dangerous"},{"g":"to jump"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"in / on"},null]}]}